# A glossy classic bath duckling: round head and body, a flat bottom (no feet), a white shine on
# the top-left, a little tail flick. It waddles by rocking (step) and squeak-hops; quack opens the
# beak. Its own shape, rounder than the mini duck.
name: mini-bath-duck
size: 16x16
palette:
  K #2a1f2d
  E #1e1620
  Y #ffea00
  S #e6b800
  W #ffffff
  O #ffaa00
  o #d97f00
  P #c2410c

